{% comment %}
  Render the icon-selector component with customizable options:

  - `icon_type`: Specifies the type of icon. Options: `[ icon_pack, svg ]`. - required

  - `icon_pack_icon`: Provide the name of the icon pack icon. - required
  - `svg_icon`: Provide the name of the SVG icon. - required

  - `color`: Provide the color of icon. - not required

  - `width`: Sets the custom width for SVG icons (only for SVG). - not required
  - `height`: Sets the custom height for SVG icons (only for SVG). - not required

  - `icon_pack_icon_style`: Specifies the style for icon packs. Options: `[ colored ]`. - not required
  - `icon_pack_icon_fill_type`: Defines the fill type for icon packs. Options: `[ gradient ]`. - not required
  - `icon_pack_icon_size`: Determines the icon size in pixels (integer only; no "px" suffix needed). - not required



  Example code:
      {%
       render "icon-selector",

       icon_type:type,

       icon_pack_icon: icon_pack_icon,
       svg_icon: svg_icon,
       color:color,

       width: width,
       height: height,

       icon_pack_icon_style: style,
       icon_pack_icon_fill_type: fill_type,
       icon_pack_icon_size: size
      %}

      ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
      | Note: All SVG and icon pack schemas are provided at the end of the code.            |
      | Please ensure you update this section if any new SVGs or icon pack icons are added. |
      ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{% endcomment %}
{% if section and icon_pack_icon == 'none' and svg_icon == 'none' %}
  {% style %}
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} div.aic__icon--shadow:has(> .icon__wrap), #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} div.multicolumn-card__image-wrapper--icon.multicolumn-card__image-wrapper--shadow:has(> .icon__wrap){
      background:transparent !important;
      box-shadow:none !important;
    }
  {% endstyle %}
{% endif %}

{% capture icon_pack %}
    <i class="icon icon-pack icon-{{ icon_pack_icon }}
            {% if icon_pack_icon_style == 'colored' and icon_pack_icon_fill_type == 'gradient' %} text-gradient {% endif %}"
       style="{% if icon_pack_icon_size != blank %}font-size: {{ icon_pack_icon_size }}px;{% endif %} {% if color != blank %}color:{{ color }};{% endif %}">
    </i>
{% endcapture %}

